Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">商汤科技开源8B轻量多模态大模型SenseNova U1.5Lite</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI全面开源Codex Harness框架，开放AI编程智能体底层运行能力</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic在Claude Platform正式上线Computer Use、Skills API与Files API</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里巴巴开源 Qwen-UI-Agent 真机多模态 GUI 智能体基座模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9441ff3cea1797e0f581040dd68e13eb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里巴巴正式开源 Qwen-UI-Agent，这是一款面向真实世界环境的 GUI 智能体基座模型，全面覆盖移动端、电脑端、网页端及深度搜索场景。该模型在 MobileWorld 测试中取得 82.1% 的得分，在自建的 MobileWorld-Real 真机基准（涵盖 100 多台手机及 150 多个应用）上成功率达 92.2%，在 OSWorld-Verified 和 WebArena 测试中亦表现领先。Qwen-UI-Agent 支持命令行操作与批量动作输出，能有效缩短执行轨迹。在安全管控方面，模型内置全过程判断机制，针对违法请求直接拒绝，并在支付、隐私授权等敏感步骤主动暂停等待确认。此外，该模型支持超过 100 步的超长轨迹在线强化学习训练，配合自适应课程学习，显著提升了处理复杂长程任务的能力，旨在解决</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">豆包工作任务模式上线技能、连接器与工作伙伴三大功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f8bb140131f33454b4f6258b393c4b73.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">豆包工作任务模式近日迎来重大更新，正式推出技能、连接器与工作伙伴三大功能，标志着其从对话助手向智能办公平台转型。目前平台已上架超200个技能与连接器，并支持用户自主创建专属技能以固化工作流。其中，技能功能允许用户保存个性化工作方法，实现流程复用；连接器则打通了豆包与飞书等外部办公工具，支持直接在应用内处理任务与查找资料，减少页面切换。工作伙伴功能提供数据分析、内容策划、科研及金融等领域的专业智能体，用户可组建智能体小队协同完成复杂任务。三大功能支持自由组合，用户可通过技能留存标准、连接器调取信息、联合智能体落地执行。目前，用户可通过豆包电脑版侧边栏体验上述功能，该更新旨在简化办公流程，提升职场协同效率。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">商汤科技开源8B轻量多模态大模型SenseNova U1.5Lite</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4e71235650c86de862e9f9e97c6d2c8b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">商汤科技正式开源轻量级多模态大模型SenseNova U1.5Lite，该模型参数量为8B，在多项核心视觉任务中表现出色。SenseNova U1.5Lite原生支持3至4K上下文长度，具备原生4K高分辨率输出能力，在高分辨率生成中可兼顾宏观构图与微小文字、肌理及光影细节。在功能特性上，该模型显著提升了视觉生成质量，增强了主体身份、空间结构及版式关系的保持度，并支持局部修改、元素替换及多参考图编辑。针对复杂排版，模型强化了中英文文字渲染、海报及品牌视觉处理能力。在视觉控制方面，支持Bounding Box、Visual Marker及多图参考等多种方式，可实现对指定区域和对象的精确编辑。该模型的发布旨在通过轻量化架构，为开发者提供媲美超大规模商业模型的视觉生成与编辑交付水平，推动生成内容向完整视觉表达演进。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI全面开源Codex Harness框架，开放AI编程智能体底层运行能力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3dc7558b6757f99938aa45834da1392c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI近日全面开源Codex Harness，将驱动Codex智能体运行的核心框架向开发者开放。Codex Harness作为连接模型、用户与工具的Agent执行环境，涵盖Agent Loop、线程生命周期管理、持久化、身份认证及工具扩展机制。开发者可通过Codex App Server利用双向JSON-RPC协议将Harness接入IDE、桌面应用等客户端，实现实时事件流处理。该框架目前已支撑Codex Web、CLI及macOS应用等场景。OpenAI内部实践显示，基于Harness的工程模式可实现“人类设定目标、Agent执行”的开发闭环，曾支撑内部产品在5个月内完成约100万行代码编写与1500个Pull Request。此次开源标志着AI编程竞争从单一模型能力转向Agent运行时、上下文管理及工</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic在Claude Platform正式上线Computer Use、Skills API与Files API</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/080fe9189b1afd9bb85fd10d4f20ed83.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic宣布Claude Platform的Computer Use、Skills API及Files API全面进入GA阶段。核心更新包括：Computer Use功能支持单次调用执行多项连续动作，并符合HIPAA标准，可用于医疗负载；新增浏览器使用工具（Browser use tool），具备网页结构解析能力，可精准识别并操作网页元素。Skills API支持企业管理专属技能文件夹，并在代码执行沙盒中运行；Files API提供1TB专属存储空间，支持PDF及电子表格上传，速率限制提升至原先的5倍，并引入自动过期机制。上述功能旨在赋能企业构建生产级智能体，除Claude Platform外，Computer Use与浏览器工具即将登陆Google Cloud Vertex AI，Skills AP</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
